OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fshowers at first in the southwest,
OL,7,Flargely fading out out through the
OL,8,Fevening and overnight. Otherwise dry
OL,9,Fwith clear spells and some patchy
OL,10,Frural frost possible in places.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAfter a quite chilly start it
OL,13,Fwill be dry with bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells and light winds. Freshening
OL,15,Fwinds with cloud and patchy rain late
OL,16,Fin the southwest in evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
